<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>Lesson Summary</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01525</md:content-id>
    <md:title>Lesson Summary</md:title>
    <md:uuid>16c2e7c2-7a7c-4367-a841-c47ee37b623e</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section id="sect-00001"><para id="para-00001">In this lesson, you learned how to:</para>
<list id="list-00001">
  <item>Calculate rates of change of functions given graphs, equations, or tables.</item>
  <item>Use rates of change to describe how a linear function and an exponential function change over equal intervals.</item>
</list>
<para id="para-00002">Here are the <emphasis>activities</emphasis> that helped you reach those goals:</para>
<list id="list-00002">
  <item>5.15.1: Writing Equivalent Expressions <list id="list-00003">
    <item>In this activity, you practiced writing equivalent expressions using the order of operations, combining like terms, and using properties of exponents.</item>
  </list></item>
 
  <item>5.15.2: Linear Function Constant Rate of Change <list id="list-00004">
    <item>In this activity, you revisited and extended your understanding of the constant rate of change for a linear function.</item>
    <item>5.15.2: Self Check</item>
    <item>5.15.2: Additional Resources</item>
  </list></item>
 
  <item>5.15.3: Growth Rate of an Exponential Function <list id="list-00005">
    <item>In this activity, you examined what happens to the values of an exponential function <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>f</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> when the input is increased by 1 and then when its value changes by a factor of <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</item>
    <item>5.15.3: Self Check</item>
    <item>5.15.3: Additional Resources</item>
  </list></item>
 
  <item>5.15.4: Comparing Linear and Exponential Growth <list id="list-00006">
    <item>In this activity, you compared linear and exponential growth.</item>
  </list></item>
 
</list>
<para id="para-00003">After these activities, you completed the following <emphasis>practice</emphasis>:</para>
<list id="list-00007">
  <item>5.15.5: Practice</item>
</list>
<section class="checking-in" id="sect-00002"><title>Checking In</title><exercise id="_68c90734-a21b-4539-badf-867b0ee4808e" class="multiple-choice"><problem id="prob-00001"><para id="para-00004">On a scale of 1 to 5, how confident do you feel about the learning goals of this lesson?</para></problem><solution id="sol-00001"><para id="para-00005">Nice reflection! You learn more when you take the time to reflect on your thinking.</para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
</document>
